{"video": "ocda-016-salac-video.mp4", "duration": 436.813787, "chunk_seconds": 20.0, "stride_seconds": 15.0, "with_audio": false, "with_video": false, "claims": [{"claim_id": "cl-001", "claim_text": "At approximately 0115 hours, Orange County Communications Center received a 911 call from a cell phone reporting a residential burglary in progress."}, {"claim_id": "cl-002", "claim_text": "The caller reported hearing glass breaking and stated that an intruder had entered the home through a front window."}, {"claim_id": "cl-003", "claim_text": "I was the first unit to arrive at approximately 0105 hours."}, {"claim_id": "cl-004", "claim_text": "Within approximately thirty seconds of beginning my approach, I observed the subject standing under a tree on the sidewalk south of the residence."}, {"claim_id": "cl-005", "claim_text": "I observed that she was holding what appeared to be a black handgun at her side in her right hand, pointed toward the ground."}, {"claim_id": "cl-006", "claim_text": "Deputies Orozco and Yoon arrived approximately five minutes after my initial contact with the subject."}, {"claim_id": "cl-007", "claim_text": "The three of us continued issuing verbal commands over the following several minutes."}, {"claim_id": "cl-008", "claim_text": "The subject slowly began walking in my direction, holding the weapon at shoulder height with both hands. She then reversed course and walked back toward the tree."}, {"claim_id": "cl-009", "claim_text": "Deputy Faulkner arrived last and retrieved a rifle from his vehicle before joining our position."}, {"claim_id": "cl-010", "claim_text": "The subject had been standing under the tree for approximately ten minutes since my initial contact."}, {"claim_id": "cl-011", "claim_text": "The subject immediately collapsed and the weapon dropped from her hands."}, {"claim_id": "cl-012", "claim_text": "Paramedics arrived at approximately 0125 hours, approximately ten minutes after the shooting."}, {"claim_id": "cl-013", "claim_t